    "message": "Check resource losses on the shared generated Scenario\n\nThe resource-loss tests built their own Scenario with\nInitialScenarioBuilder (12 evacuees, seed 7) to schedule a loss or a\nstaff absence. They now pass those operational conditions to the\nshared generated_scenario_with fixture (#88).\n\nThe two per-tick check tests join the other WorldState unit tests; the\nrun to the end stays here as the integration test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
